What is Personal Care & Cosmetics Packaging?
Personal care and cosmetics packaging comprises the materials, containers, and secondary solutions designed to protect, preserve, and present beauty, hygiene, and wellness products. It spans a wide variety of formats-plastic bottles, glass jars, airless pumps, squeezable tubes, compacts, sachets, and emerging biodegradable or refillable systems. While the core functions remain product integrity, safety, and shelf life extension, packaging also serves as a powerful brand communication tool, influencing purchase decisions through visual appeal, tactile experience, and functional convenience.
